    "sections": {
        "description": "The Kids Birthday Party WordPress Theme is a vibrant, responsive, and user-friendly theme designed to help you create a fun and engaging website for birthday event planning. Whether you're a party planner, run a party supplies business, or organizing a celebration for your child, this theme makes it easy to showcase your services and ideas. It features colorful visuals, playful fonts, and cheerful layouts that reflect the joy of a birthday celebration. Built-in templates allow you to list venues, party packages, and entertainment options like magicians, clowns, photographers, and catering. You can also highlight decorative elements and activities to inspire visitors. The theme is versatile enough to suit both kids and adult birthday events, from milestone parties to virtual celebrations, and includes features like RSVP tracking and countdown timers. Ideal for event planners and entertainers, it helps you present your offerings in a lively and professional way."
    },
